# GRUB SHIFT: the job table. Contracts 1-3 give ten shifts, 4-6 nine, then
# eight; the quota is always 30. The field has 1 sinkhole and 4-6 planters,
# 2 sinkholes on every second contract of three, 7-8 planters on every third.
# From contract 10 one colour hatches already grown, from 13 two; past 15 the
# table loops through 13-15.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 11
expect days == 10
expect quota == 30
expect holes == 1
expect planters >= 4
expect planters <= 6
expect grown_types == 0
cheat contract 2 12
expect days == 10
expect holes == 2
expect planters >= 4
expect planters <= 6
cheat contract 3 12
expect days == 10
expect holes == 1
expect planters >= 7
expect planters <= 8
cheat contract 4 13
expect days == 9
cheat contract 6 14
expect days == 9
expect planters >= 7
cheat contract 7 15
expect days == 8
expect grown_types == 0
cheat contract 10 16
expect grown_types == 1
cheat contract 13 17
expect grown_types == 2
cheat contract 17 18
expect grown_types == 2
expect days == 8
expect holes == 2
